TI  - Serial antenatal monitoring compared with labor induction in post‐term pregnancies
AU  - H. Almström
AU  - Lena Granström
AU  - G. Ekman
JO  - Acta Obstetricia Et Gynecologica Scandinavica
PY  - 1995
VL  - 74
IS  - 8
SP  - 599
