TI  - Systematic Review: Elective Induction of Labor Versus Expectant Management of Pregnancy
AU  - Aaron B. Caughey
AU  - Vandana Sundaram
AU  - Anjali J. Kaimal
AU  - Allison Gienger
AU  - Yvonne W. Cheng
AU  - Kathryn M. McDonald
AU  - Brian L. Shaffer
