TI  - Post-term pregnancy: should induction of labor be considered before 42 weeks?
AU  - M. Treger
AU  - Mordechai Hallak
AU  - Tali Silberstein
AU  - Michael Friger
AU  - M Katz
AU  - M. Mazor
JO  - The Journal of Maternal-Fetal & Neonatal Medicine
PY  - 2002
VL  - 11
IS  - 1
SP  - 50
