TI  - Single indications of induction of labor with prostaglandins and risk of cesarean delivery: A retrospective cohort study
AU  - Sandro Gerli
AU  - Alessandro Favilli
AU  - Claudia Giordano
AU  - Vittorio Bini
AU  - Gian Carlo Di Renzo
