TI  - Induction of labour at 41 weeks versus expectant management and induction of labour at 42 weeks (SWEdish Post-term Induction Study, SWEPIS): multicentre, open label, randomised, superiority trial
AU  - Ulla‐Britt Wennerholm
AU  - Sissel Saltvedt
