TI  - Balancing harm and benefit for induction of labor at 41 weeks: Slow acting is the problem
AU  - Anita C.J. Ravelli
AU  - Joris van der Post
AU  - Christianne J.M. de Groot
AU  - Ameen Abu‐Hanna
AU  - Martine Eskes
